# Keep LF in the working tree on every OS: the shell scripts run under Linux/WSL.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Patches must be stored byte-for-byte: the Goodix touch driver sources use CRLF line endings,
# and the patches that touch them carry those CRs in their context lines (apply with `git am --keep-cr`).
*.patch -text

*.img binary
*.bin binary
